# DATABASE_URL and UPLOAD_DIR are intentionally NOT set here. In Docker the
# Dockerfile points them at /data/... (the persistent volume). On the host
# (no Docker) config.py falls back to ./sounds.db and ./uploads.
# Setting them here would override the Docker defaults and silently put
# data inside the container filesystem, which is wiped on `compose down`.
